Inventory takes Sender and Message
Give back "inventory<-payment:paid"

Payment takes Sender and Message
Give back "payment<-inventory:reserved"

Mediate takes Sender and Recipient and Message
If Recipient is "inventory"
Give back Inventory taking Sender, Message

If Recipient is "payment"
Give back Payment taking Sender, Message

Give back "UnknownColleague"

Put Mediate taking "payment", "inventory", "paid" into First Route
Put Mediate taking "inventory", "payment", "reserved" into Second Route
Put Mediate taking "payment", "shipping", "dispatch" into Missing Route

If First Route is "inventory<-payment:paid"
If Second Route is "payment<-inventory:reserved"
If Missing Route is "UnknownColleague"
Print "Rockstar Mediator: passed"

